                <p>Born on 01 July 1985 to a farmer's family Sachin Chaudhary is youngest in four kids of Sh. Kalu Singh Chaudhary and Smt. Narindar Kaur of Village Kaniya Kalyanpur of Garhmukteshwar Vidhan Sabha that lies in Amroha constituency.
</p>
<p>
He is married to Abha Chaudhary of village Khairpur, Bulandshahar. He has two kids Aaradhaya (10 years) & Veer (5 years). Due to family problems Sachin Chaudhary couldn't take enough education. He is 12th class passed from KGK College, Moradabad. He started his career in sales and marketing he earned the top levels in his profession due to his good public dealing skills. After a career of 13 years in sales he founded a builder's company Aaradhayam Builders in Moradabad the net worth of the company is 600 Crores now and it is the best selling and growing company of the real estate in Western UP. Moved by the problems of underprivileged Sachin Chaudhary left the professional life as an entrepreneur and decided to join the politics to serve people and nation. Publically he joined the politics in 2018 and fought his first election as the Congress party MP Candidate from Amroha constituency of UP in the Loksabha Election of 2019.
</p>
                

                

